**Summary:** Polished single-screen arcade on HTML5 Canvas (920×518, 60fps). Move the harbor boat left/right with **←→ / A/D**, touch drag, and on-screen ◀▶ buttons to catch neon buoys (+10/+20/+30/+50) and avoid mines. Score, 3 lives (♥), level & speed ramp every **250 pts** (1.0×→2.6×, spawn 0.85s→0.38s), start/pause (P/Esc)/restart (R/Enter/Space) flow, WebAudio bleeps, particles + **26px stroked floating +score pops**, screen shake/hit flash, LocalStorage high score, fully responsive (16:9→4:3→1:1).

**Public game link:** \`index.html\` at repo root — run \`python3 -m http.server 3000\` and open http://127.0.0.1:3000/index.html (tmux session \`app-server\` active on port 3000) or view raw: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/$REPO/$COMMIT/index.html

**Final commit:** https://github.com/$REPO/commit/$COMMIT

